        "body": "Symbotic Inc. is a public company headquartered in Wilmington, Massachusetts, with the ticker SYM. Its website describes the company as a provider of end-to-end warehouse automation solutions for retailers and distributors. The site says Symbotic Systems are complete automation solutions that increase facility capacity through dense storage, maximize throughput, and create efficiency gains with AI-enhanced software. The company describes its solutions as flexible for palletized goods, small quantity fulfillment, and omnichannel operations, handling goods from 1 lb (0.5 kg) and 2 x 6.4 x 5 in (5.1 x 16.3 x 12.7 cm) to 60 lb (27.2 kg) and 36 x 24 x 16.2 in (91.4 x 61 x 41.2 cm).\n\nThe site positions Symbotic as a leader in industrial automation and technology, innovating through robotics and AI. It refers to AI software and AI-enhanced software as part of its warehouse systems, but does not name specific AI products beyond Symbotic Solutions and Symbotic Systems. The company's SEC filing identifier is CIK 0001837240.\n\nMassachusetts court records include 191 entries associated with Symbotic Inc. The company is also recorded under the alias SYMBOTIC INC.",
